OL,3,GNEWSACall to end care contribution for 
OL,4,Aseasonal workers                       
OL,6,FEmployers and a union are among those  
OL,7,Fcalling for seasonal workers to be     
OL,8,Fexempt from paying for future care     
OL,9,Fcontributions.                         
OL,11,FThe contributions in Jersey "provide   
OL,12,Ffinancial support to people who need   
OL,13,Flong-term care for the rest of their   
OL,14,Flife, either at home or in a care      
OL,15,Fhome".                                 
OL,17,FJersey Farmers' Union president, Doug  
OL,18,FRichardson, said it was unfair seasonal
OL,19,Fworkers had to pay for care "they will 
OL,20,Fnever receive". He said the charges    
OL,21,Fmade the island a less attractive place
OL,22,Ffor workers.                           
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
