OL,3,GNEWSACall to end care contribution for 
OL,4,Aseasonal workers                       
OL,6,FMinister for Social Security, Elaine   
OL,7,FMillar, said seasonal workers were     
OL,8,Fimportant to the island's economy. But 
OL,9,Flong-term care contributions were made 
OL,10,Fby workers in Jersey, whether seasonal 
OL,11,For permanent.                          
